  7   4010              VARS    EQU RAM_START + $100    ; the program's variables: the code is in ROM
  8   4010              IM2_TABLE EQU $C200             ; 257 bytes of $C3: every vector is $C3C3
  9   4010              IM2_JUMP  EQU $C3C3             ; and there, a JP to the routine
 10   4010              nwait   EQU VARS                ; lines of vwait: 119 at 50 Hz, 68 at 60 Hz
 11   4010              ; The paper transparent: every pattern byte 0, every colour 0, so that the
 12   4010              ; backdrop shows on the whole line. Each line of the paper gets a backdrop of
 13   4010              ; its own, black and white in turn, written k T-states later in the line in
 14   4010              ; turn k than in turn 0, k = 0 to 10 (measD.py reads the T-state of every
 15   4010              ; write): the photograph shows where the VDP was.
